{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34432","headline":"和袭美新秋即事次韵三首 二 · 陆龟蒙","name":"和袭美新秋即事次韵三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"帆檝衣裳尽钓徒，往来踪迹遍三吴。\n闲中展卷兴亡小，醉後题诗点画麤。\n松岛伴谭多道气，竹窗孤梦岂良图。\n还须待致昇平了，即往扁舟放五湖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34432.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34432","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}